{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","上境图-epigraph","下半连续函数-lsc","凸函数-convex-function"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Convex Functions, Epigraphs and Lower Semicontinuity","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"凸函数-convex-function\"></a></p>\n<h1>凸函数 Convex Function</h1>\n<p>函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f：R^n→R</span> 是 <strong>凸</strong>(convex) 的，如果 <span class=\"math inline\">\\text{dom} f</span> 是凸集，且对所有的 <span class=\"math inline\">x，y∈\\text{dom} f</span>，和 <span class=\"math inline\">0≤θ≤1</span> ，都有</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nf(\\theta x+(1-\\theta)y) ≤ \\theta f(x)+(1-\\theta)f(y)\n</div>\n\n<p><img src=\"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.convex-function/sources/ConvexFunc_ManimCE_v0.18.0-8340ff945.png\" alt=\"convexfunc\"></p>\n<p><a id=\"上境图-epigraph\"></a></p>\n<h2>上境图 EpiGraph</h2>\n<p>从函数值转到集合：上境图由图像上方的点组成。凸函数与凸集通过这一构造联系起来。</p>\n<p>完整定义、原推导与例子见 <a href=\"#/learn/opt.epigraph?anchor=definition\">上境图（Epigraph）</a>。</p>\n<p><a id=\"下半连续函数-lsc\"></a></p>\n<h2>下半连续函数 LSC</h2>\n<p>进一步问上境图是否为闭集，得到下半连续性；原稿的两种等价定义移到独立节点。</p>\n<p>完整定义、原推导与例子见 <a href=\"#/learn/opt.lower-semicontinuity?anchor=definition\">下半连续性（Lower Semicontinuity）</a>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>上境图</td>\n<td>epigraph</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下半连续</td>\n<td>lower semicontinuity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸函数</td>\n<td>convex function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸集</td>\n<td>convex set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列</td>\n<td>sequence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>continuity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭集</td>\n<td>closed set</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"opt.convex-function.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.convex-function","resources":[{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.convex-function/sources/ConvexFunc-20bf6d950.mp4","id":"imported-video-20bf6d95","owner_id":"opt.convex-function","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.convex-function/sources/ConvexFunc-20bf6d950.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","type":"video"}],"schema_version":1,"title":"凸函数、上图与下半连续性"}],"anchors":["definition","上境图-epigraph","下半连续函数-lsc","凸函数-convex-function"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition","上境图-epigraph","下半连续函数-lsc","凸函数-convex-function"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Convex Functions, Epigraphs and Lower Semicontinuity","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"凸函数-convex-function\"></a></p>\n<h1>凸函数 Convex Function</h1>\n<p>函数 <span class=\"math inline\">f：R^n→R</span> 是 <strong>凸</strong>(convex) 的，如果 <span class=\"math inline\">\\text{dom} f</span> 是凸集，且对所有的 <span class=\"math inline\">x，y∈\\text{dom} f</span>，和 <span class=\"math inline\">0≤θ≤1</span> ，都有</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nf(\\theta x+(1-\\theta)y) ≤ \\theta f(x)+(1-\\theta)f(y)\n</div>\n\n<p><img src=\"/MTreeLab/assets/opt.convex-function/sources/ConvexFunc_ManimCE_v0.18.0-8340ff945.png\" alt=\"convexfunc\"></p>\n<p><a id=\"上境图-epigraph\"></a></p>\n<h2>上境图 EpiGraph</h2>\n<p>从函数值转到集合：上境图由图像上方的点组成。凸函数与凸集通过这一构造联系起来。</p>\n<p>完整定义、原推导与例子见 <a href=\"#/learn/opt.epigraph?anchor=definition\">上境图（Epigraph）</a>。</p>\n<p><a id=\"下半连续函数-lsc\"></a></p>\n<h2>下半连续函数 LSC</h2>\n<p>进一步问上境图是否为闭集，得到下半连续性；原稿的两种等价定义移到独立节点。</p>\n<p>完整定义、原推导与例子见 <a href=\"#/learn/opt.lower-semicontinuity?anchor=definition\">下半连续性（Lower Semicontinuity）</a>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>上境图</td>\n<td>epigraph</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下半连续</td>\n<td>lower semicontinuity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸函数</td>\n<td>convex function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸集</td>\n<td>convex set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列</td>\n<td>sequence</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>continuity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭集</td>\n<td>closed set</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"opt.convex-function.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"opt.conv